  "version": "0.9.0-alpha.3",
  "notes": "## 0.9.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-12\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- Clipboard sync now requires paired desktop devices to be on this release or later, because older alpha builds may not receive new clipboard items from upgraded devices.\n\n### Features\n\n- Show the active connection address in the paired devices list so it is easier to see how each online device is connected.\n- Make Appearance settings clearer by letting Light, Dark, and System themes be selected directly from preview cards.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Let users unlock with their space passphrase when automatic unlock cannot recover the saved key.\n- Improve Linux responsiveness by reducing heavy visual effects that can slow down rendering.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.9.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-12\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- 剪贴板同步现在要求已配对的桌面设备升级到此版本或更新版本，否则旧 alpha 版本可能无法接收升级后设备发送的新剪贴板内容。\n\n### Features\n\n- 在已配对设备列表中显示当前连接地址，方便确认在线设备的连接方式。\n- 改进外观设置，现在可以直接通过预览卡片选择浅色、深色或跟随系统主题。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 当自动解锁无法恢复已保存密钥时，用户现在可以输入空间口令手动解锁。\n- 在 Linux 上减少容易拖慢渲染的重视觉效果，提升界面响应速度。",
